    "text": "NBC San Diego\nwebsite\nSan Diego\nRescue dog to become 1st Shelter to Soldier ‘morale dog' to be stationed on U.S. Navy ship\nBy Audra Stafford,\n4 hours agoFor the last decade, local nonprofit Shelter to Soldier has been training shelter dogs to be psychiatric service animals for military veterans. Now, it's working directly with the U.S. Navy to bring the healing powers of these pups to thousands of active-duty Marines and sailors by placing “morale dogs” on ships full-time.\n15",
